  "prefLabel": "He-W 806.99 Redetermination of Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 806.99 Redetermination of Eligibility.\n\n(a) For a desk review, as defined in He-W 801.03, the individual shall provide the required verification of the change in case circumstances no later than 10 calendar days from the date on the notice requesting the required verification.\n\n(b) For a full redetermination, for individuals whose eligibility cannot be renewed based on the information known to the department, individuals shall provide the required verification no later than 10 calendar days from the date on the notice requesting the required verification.\n\nSource. #13875, eff 2-21-24\n\nPARTS He-W 807 through He-W 815 - RESERVED",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
}
